---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Dean Phillips"
  description="Dean Phillips: software developer with 20+ years in defense and private-sector software, building apps with an AI-first workflow. Maker of RepBunny."
  ogDescription="20+ years of production software. Now building apps with an AI-first workflow. Maker of RepBunny."
>
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div>
      <p class="pill"><i></i>20+ years shipping production software</p>
      <h1>Seasoned developer.<br><span class="grad-text">AI-powered workflow.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm Dean Phillips. I've spent two decades building software for defense and private industry, from flight control systems to the web apps that run whole businesses. Now I'm using AI to build products with the speed of a startup and the discipline of a veteran.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="#how">See how I build</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="portrait"><img src="/img/dean-640.webp" alt="Dean Phillips" width="360" height="360"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap stats">
    <div class="stat"><b class="grad-text">20+</b><span>years writing production software</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b class="grad-text">7</b><span>industries, from aerospace to banking</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b class="grad-text">500+</b><span>RepBunny commits in its first three weeks</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b class="grad-text">630+</b><span>automated tests guarding every RepBunny release</span></div>
  </div>

  <section class="wrap" id="experience">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
      <h2>Two decades, a lot of ground covered</h2>
      <p>I started on embedded flight and propulsion control software, then moved to web development, where I've built and led work across a long list of industries.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">Flight &amp; propulsion control</span>
      <span class="chip">Aircraft depot maintenance</span>
      <span class="chip">Mortgage</span>
      <span class="chip">Valuation products</span>
      <span class="chip">Payroll</span>
      <span class="chip">Energy</span>
      <span class="chip hot">Banking &amp; lending (today)</span>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Most of that work was for defense and private companies, so it isn't public. RepBunny is the one you can try yourself.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="how">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How I build</p>
      <h2>AI at every step, <span class="grad-text">from idea to inbox</span></h2>
      <p>Writing code is one slice of shipping a product. I use AI from the first idea to the support inbox, so a team of one can move like a team of ten. This is the actual workflow behind RepBunny.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pipeline">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><g class="dim"><rect x="22" y="22" width="34" height="26" rx="5"/><path d="M29 31h20M29 39h13"/><rect x="186" y="58" width="34" height="26" rx="5"/><path d="M193 67h20M193 75h12"/></g>
<circle class="tf" cx="120" cy="46" r="24"/>
<path class="t" d="M108 66c-7-5-12-12-12-20a24 24 0 0 1 48 0c0 8-5 15-12 20v8h-24z"/>
<path class="t" d="M110 84h20M113 92h14"/>
<path class="v" d="M114 46l6 8 6-8M120 54v12"/>
<g class="v"><path d="M120 8v-2M86 20l-3-3M154 20l3-3M78 46h-4M162 46h4"/></g>
<g class="spark"><path d="M70 82l2 5 5 2-5 2-2 5-2-5-5-2 5-2z"/><path d="M172 18l1.5 3.5 3.5 1.5-3.5 1.5-1.5 3.5-1.5-3.5-3.5-1.5 3.5-1.5z"/></g></svg></div>
        <h3><small>01 Ideate</small>AI product and UX reviews</h3>
        <p>Agents walk the app like a product manager and a UX designer would, then file the gaps they find as scored backlog items.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="dim" x="28" y="12" width="184" height="88" rx="10"/>
<path class="dim" d="M89 22v68M151 22v68"/>
<rect class="tf t" x="38" y="24" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/><rect class="tf t" x="38" y="46" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/><rect class="tf t" x="38" y="68" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/>
<rect class="vf v" x="99" y="24" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/><rect class="vf v" x="99" y="46" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/>
<rect class="tf t" x="161" y="24" width="42" height="16" rx="4"/>
<path class="ok" d="M174 32l4 4 8-8"/>
<path class="v" d="M84 54c4 0 6-3 10-3" stroke-dasharray="2 4"/></svg></div>
        <h3><small>02 Plan</small>Rough ideas become clear specs</h3>
        <p>A quick note from my phone gets researched against the code and rewritten into a buildable spec, scored by effort and value.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="dim" x="34" y="10" width="172" height="90" rx="10"/>
<path class="dim" d="M34 28h172"/>
<g class="dots"><circle cx="48" cy="19" r="3"/><circle cx="58" cy="19" r="3"/><circle cx="68" cy="19" r="3"/></g>
<path class="v" d="M50 44l-8 8 8 8"/><path class="v" d="M190 44l8 8-8 8"/>
<path class="t" d="M64 42h44M64 52h70M76 62h52M76 72h34M64 82h24"/>
<path class="v" d="M116 42h22M142 52h20M118 72h30"/>
<rect class="cursor" x="94" y="77" width="3" height="10" rx="1"/></svg></div>
        <h3><small>03 Build</small>Agents work the backlog</h3>
        <p>An automated runner picks the highest-value issue, builds it, and moves on to the next. I set direction and make the calls only a person should make.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="dim" x="56" y="8" width="58" height="96" rx="11"/>
<path class="dim" d="M78 15h14"/>
<g class="ok"><path d="M66 32l3 3 6-6"/><path d="M66 50l3 3 6-6"/><path d="M66 68l3 3 6-6"/></g>
<path class="t" d="M82 32h22M82 50h18M82 68h22"/>
<path class="tf t" d="M162 18l30 10v22c0 20-14 32-30 38-16-6-30-18-30-38V28z"/>
<path class="ok big" d="M149 52l9 9 18-18"/>
<g class="spark"><path d="M206 80l1.5 3.5 3.5 1.5-3.5 1.5-1.5 3.5-1.5-3.5-3.5-1.5 3.5-1.5z"/></g></svg></div>
        <h3><small>04 Verify</small>Nothing ships untested</h3>
        <p>Every change has to pass a full build and more than 630 end-to-end tests before it reaches anyone's phone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path class="v" d="M24 100C70 98 120 80 160 38" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/>
<g transform="translate(176 26) rotate(45)">
<path class="tf t" d="M0-26c10 8 12 22 8 36H-8c-4-14-2-28 8-36z"/>
<circle class="t" cx="0" cy="-6" r="4"/>
<path class="t" d="M-8 4l-8 10 8-1M8 4l8 10-8-1"/>
<path class="flame" d="M-5 13c1 7 3 10 5 14 2-4 4-7 5-14"/></g>
<g class="spark"><path d="M40 24l2 5 5 2-5 2-2 5-2-5-5-2 5-2z"/><path d="M210 78l1.5 3.5 3.5 1.5-3.5 1.5-1.5 3.5-1.5-3.5-3.5-1.5 3.5-1.5z"/><path d="M96 30l1.5 3.5 3.5 1.5-3.5 1.5-1.5 3.5-1.5-3.5-3.5-1.5 3.5-1.5z"/></g>
<g class="dim"><circle cx="70" cy="56" r="1.5"/><circle cx="214" cy="30" r="1.5"/><circle cx="130" cy="96" r="1.5"/></g></svg></div>
        <h3><small>05 Ship</small>Cloud builds for both phones</h3>
        <p>iPhone builds are signed and sent to TestFlight from the cloud with no Mac in the house, and Android builds go out on their own every night.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 110" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path class="dim" d="M40 46h84v52H40z"/>
<path class="dim" d="M40 46l42 30 42-30"/>
<rect class="vf v" x="54" y="14" width="56" height="44" rx="5"/>
<path class="v" d="M63 26h38M63 35h30M63 44h34"/>
<path class="t" d="M134 62c18 0 30-10 34-26" />
<path class="t" d="M162 36l6 0 0 6"/>
<circle class="tf t" cx="192" cy="68" r="18"/>
<path class="ok big" d="M184 68l6 6 11-11"/>
<g class="spark"><path d="M206 28l1.5 3.5 3.5 1.5-3.5 1.5-1.5 3.5-1.5-3.5-3.5-1.5 3.5-1.5z"/></g></svg></div>
        <h3><small>06 Support</small>Support and marketing, too</h3>
        <p>AI reads incoming support email, turns real bugs into backlog issues once I OK them, and drafts a reply that I review, edit, and approve before it goes out. Store screenshots and how-to guides are captured automatically too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="pipeline-foot">The result: an app that went from first commit to TestFlight in under three weeks, with tests, docs, and a marketing site along for the ride. <a href="/blog/ai-delivery-team/">Read the full write-up</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="repbunny">
    <div class="app-band">
      <div>
        <div class="app-head">
          <img src="/img/repbunny-icon.png" alt="" width="68" height="68">
          <div>
            <h2>RepBunny</h2>
            <p class="status">Coming soon to iPhone and Android</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>A strength training log that's quick to use between sets, and a little bit adorable. I built it because I wanted it for my own workouts.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Log weight and reps in a couple of taps</li>
          <li>Repeat the routines you care about with templates</li>
          <li>Watch your progress add up on clear charts</li>
          <li>Your workouts stay on your phone, no account needed</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn" href="https://repbunny.app">Visit repbunny.app</a>
      </div>
      <div class="shots">
        <img src="/img/shot-logging.webp" alt="Logging bench press sets in RepBunny" width="480" height="817">
        <img src="/img/shot-progress-chart.webp" alt="Bench press progress chart in RepBunny" width="480" height="817">
        <img src="/img/shot-rest-timer.webp" alt="RepBunny rest timer between sets" width="480" height="817">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="about">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Off the clock</p>
      <h2>The person behind the commits</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about">
      <p>I'm a dad and a granddad, and family comes first. When I'm not at a keyboard you'll find me in the gym, in the kitchen, or making art.</p>
      <p class="muted">I've used Android as my daily phone for over a decade, so building RepBunny for both platforms felt overdue.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="contact">
    <div class="contact">
      <h2>Let's <span class="grad-text">talk</span></h2>
      <p>Questions about RepBunny, how I build with AI, or something you're working on? Send me a note.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:me@deanphillips.dev">me@deanphillips.dev</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  section.wrap { padding-top: 72px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
  .section-head { max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .section-head p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; font-size: 1.08rem; }

  /* Hero */
  .hero { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
  .pill {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card) 70%, transparent);
    font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .pill i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--teal); }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 560px; }
  .cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .portrait { position: relative; justify-self: center; }
  .portrait::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -10px; border-radius: 32px; background: var(--grad); opacity: 0.85; transform: rotate(-4deg);
  }
  .portrait img { position: relative; display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 360px; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 28px; }

  /* Stats */
  .stats { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .stat { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 20px; }
  .stat b { display: block; font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.1; }
  .stat span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }

  /* Experience */
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .chip { padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); font-weight: 500; }
  .chip.hot { border-color: var(--teal); }
  .note { color: var(--muted); max-width: 680px; margin: 0; }

  /* Pipeline */
  .pipeline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .step {
    position: relative; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px;
    transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .step:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--teal); }
  .step .art {
    height: 126px; padding: 8px; margin: -6px -6px 16px; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 10%, transparent), transparent 70%), var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .step:nth-child(even) .art { background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 12%, transparent), transparent 70%), var(--bg-2); }
  .art svg { width: 100%; max-width: 240px; height: 100%; stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .art .t { stroke: var(--teal); }
  .art .v { stroke: var(--violet); }
  .art .tf { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 16%, transparent); }
  .art .vf { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 16%, transparent); }
  .art .dim { stroke: var(--muted); opacity: 0.45; }
  .art .dots circle { fill: var(--muted); opacity: 0.5; }
  .art .ok { stroke: #3ddc97; stroke-width: 3; }
  .art .ok.big { stroke-width: 4.5; }
  .art .spark { fill: var(--violet); opacity: 0.8; }
  .art .flame { stroke: #f2879c; fill: color-mix(in srgb, #f2879c 30%, transparent); }
  .art .cursor { fill: var(--teal); animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite; }
  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
  .step h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .step h3 small { display: block; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600; }
  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.97rem; }
  .pipeline-foot { margin: 26px 0 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 720px; }

  /* RepBunny */
  .app-band { background: var(--app-bg); color: #f3eef6; border-radius: 28px; padding: 44px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .app-band::after { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; right: -120px; top: -160px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--app-pink); filter: blur(120px); opacity: 0.25; pointer-events: none; }
  .app-head { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .app-head img { width: 68px; height: 68px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .app-band h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; }
  .app-band .status { margin: 2px 0 0; color: var(--app-pink); font-weight: 600; }
  .app-band p { color: #d7cfdc; }
  .app-band ul { padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px; list-style: none; }
  .app-band li { padding-left: 26px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #e6dfea; }
  .app-band li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 10px; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--app-pink); }
  .app-band .btn { background: var(--app-pink); color: var(--app-bg); }
  .shots { display: flex; gap: 14px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .shots img { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid #2c2433; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .shots img:nth-child(2) { transform: translateY(-18px); }

  /* About */
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .about p { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .about .muted { color: var(--muted); }

  /* Contact */
  .contact { text-align: center; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; padding: 56px 24px; }
  .contact h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .contact p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 auto 26px; max-width: 540px; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; padding-top: 40px; }
    .portrait { order: -1; justify-self: center; }
    .portrait img { max-width: 200px; }
    .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .pipeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .app-band { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 30px 22px; }
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    section.wrap { padding-top: 52px; padding-bottom: 52px; }
    .pipeline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stat { padding: 16px; }
    .stat b { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .shots { gap: 8px; }
    .shots img { border-radius: 10px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .step { transition: none; } .art .cursor { animation: none; } }
</style>
